OL,3,AJulio Iglesias facing court            
OL,4,Ainvestigation over alleged sexual      
OL,5,Aoffences                               
OL,7,FSinger Julio Iglesias is facing an     
OL,8,Finvestigation by Spain's national court
OL,9,Fover allegations he sexually abused and
OL,10,Fassaulted two female former staff      
OL,11,Fmembers                                
OL,13,FTwo women, who worked for the          
OL,14,F83-year-old in the Caribbean, have     
OL,15,Faccused him of abuse which they say    
OL,16,Ftook place in the Bahamas and the      
OL,17,FDominican Republic in 2021.            
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
